{"uid":"b43a319f8ad01c65","name":"E2E Purchase Flow: Integrity Check","fullName":"testcases.PurchaseEndToEndTest.endToEndPurchaseFlow","historyId":"235216eb4fbb4a476d9c424177ea7380","time":{"start":1772246131311,"stop":1772246232290,"duration":100979},"description":"### [E2E] Full Purchase Flow & Data Integrity Check\n**Objective:** Validate the entire e-commerce flow from product search to the final checkout stage, ensuring no data loss or price mismatches occur during transitions.\n\n**Test Workflow:**\n1. **Session Management:** Execute Smart Login to maintain authentication throughout the flow.\n2. **Product Acquisition:** Dynamically search and add multiple products into the shopping cart.\n3. **Cart Validation:** Perform an audit on subtotals and verify data mapping into Product Models (POJOs).\n4. **Checkout Integration:** Transfer all cart data to the Checkout page.\n5. **Final Integrity Check:** Execute a **Deep Comparison** between the Cart data and Checkout data (Matching Name, Price, and SKU).\n\n**Business Goal:** Ensure a seamless and error-free, smoothly process for the customer.\n","descriptionHtml":"<h3>[E2E] Full Purchase Flow &amp; Data Integrity Check</h3>\n<p><strong>Objective:</strong> Validate the entire e-commerce flow from product search to the final checkout stage, ensuring no data loss or price mismatches occur during transitions.</p>\n<p><strong>Test Workflow:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Session Management:</strong> Execute Smart Login to maintain authentication throughout the flow.</li>\n<li><strong>Product Acquisition:</strong> Dynamically search and add multiple products into the shopping cart.</li>\n<li><strong>Cart Validation:</strong> Perform an audit on subtotals and verify data mapping into Product Models (POJOs).</li>\n<li><strong>Checkout Integration:</strong> Transfer all cart data to the Checkout page.</li>\n<li><strong>Final Integrity Check:</strong> Execute a <strong>Deep Comparison</strong> between the Cart data and Checkout data (Matching Name, Price, and SKU).</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Business Goal:</strong> Ensure a seamless and error-free, smoothly process for the customer.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"initializeTestBaseSetup","time":{"start":1772246123933,"stop":1772246131282,"duration":7349},"description":"","status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"stepsCount":0,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"setupEndToEnd","time":{"start":1772246131308,"stop":1772246131308,"duration":0},"description":"","status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"stepsCount":0,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false}],"testStage":{"description":"### [E2E] Full Purchase Flow & Data Integrity Check\n**Objective:** Validate the entire e-commerce flow from product search to the final checkout stage, ensuring no data loss or price mismatches occur during transitions.\n\n**Test Workflow:**\n1. **Session Management:** Execute Smart Login to maintain authentication throughout the flow.\n2. **Product Acquisition:** Dynamically search and add multiple products into the shopping cart.\n3. **Cart Validation:** Perform an audit on subtotals and verify data mapping into Product Models (POJOs).\n4. **Checkout Integration:** Transfer all cart data to the Checkout page.\n5. **Final Integrity Check:** Execute a **Deep Comparison** between the Cart data and Checkout data (Matching Name, Price, and SKU).\n\n**Business Goal:** Ensure a seamless and error-free, smoothly process for the customer.\n","status":"passed","steps":[{"name":"[E2E Stage 1] Establish authenticated user session","time":{"start":1772246131337,"stop":1772246187965,"duration":56628},"status":"passed","steps":[{"name":"Check if user is successfully logged in","time":{"